Porting modifications relative to upstream:

- Trimmed to text-only LLM inference: vision, audio, diffusion and OpenCL
  support are disabled at build time; the JNI surface is reduced to what
  LlmSession needs.
- Kotlin port replaces the Java UI/ViewModel layers; classes were stripped
  of Android UI dependencies and re-wired for in-process use.
- Additions by RikkaLLM (not derived from upstream app code): the local
  OpenAI-compatible server stack (server/, including ChatOrchestrator,
  MnnOpenAiRoutes, OpenAiResponses, RequestTranslator, LocalMnnManager,
  MnnServerService) and its tool-calling prompt/parser layer (server/tools/).
